---
title: Roast Pencil Leeks
source: Nigella Express <urn:isbn:9780701181840>
author: Nigella Lawson
course: Side
servings: 6
prep time: 5m
cook time: 15m
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Easy
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- side-dish
- vegetarian
- savoury
---

Preheat oven to 220°C. Lay the @miniature leeks{300%g}(or spring onions) in a #large, shallow baking dish{} and add the @garlic oil{3%tbsp} and @salt{0.5%tsp}, then roll the leeks about to coat well. Cook in the oven for about ~{15%minutes}, by which time they should be bronzed in parts.

Decant to a serving dish and spritz with the @lemon juice{1%tbsp}.